{"detail": {"templateUuid": "da45fdccbb424461971c8c3c2f5049b1", "projectUuid": "fb70253925de4ba38197416302429934", "name": "《呈坎灵韵》", "description": "《呈坎灵韵》以徽州\"生生不息\"的八卦哲学为核，结合高德扫街榜整理的关于其受众广泛的非遗数据，通过80秒电影级影像演绎积木意象的聚散流转。影片采用呈坎色系哑光徽木积木，以榫卯咬合的精密结构呈现鱼灯、凤凰、龙溪等呈坎非遗的神性形象。镜头随积木悬浮、解构、重组与四时色变，构建\"气之聚散\"的视觉诗学。从龙溪河纹到永兴灯影，从三街九十九巷到阴阳二气，在静穆的木质纹理与流动的几何变幻间，诠释呈坎美学中虚实相生、天人合一的永恒意境，让千年八卦村的非遗根脉在数字时空涅槃新生，游呈坎一生无坎。", "coverUrl": "/assets/5953c343b03bf529.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/a7e2f42e6c3e4593811bb43ddcf333c4/d91ea563dcc69efda880fedae72927ee01c41a32.mp4", "snapshotId": 47420, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 6286853, "ownerUuid": "a7e2f42e6c3e4593811bb43ddcf333c4", "avatar": "/assets/61795706d3617908.webp", "nickname": "一帧一帧察细节", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 6, "tags": [{"id": 1501, "code": "humanity_science", "tagLabel": "人文科普", "parentTag": 1500, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1500/1501/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 3057, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "一场戏的诞生 ", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3060, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "3. 盗梦空间", "parentTag": 3057, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/3060", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6a3c0bee000000002003827d?source=webshare&xhsshare=pc_web&xsec_token=ABoWx1ODw8vPGo3nLbZUK85ndABsKIPOYB_ajOjrCAjS4=&xsec_source=pc_share", "createAt": "2026年06月29日 20:52", "updateAt": "2026年09月17日 23:07", "publishAt": "2026年09月17日 22:42", "playCount": 6, "viewCreationProcessCount": 0, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/da45fdccbb424461971c8c3